# Never commit game data
*.gbc
*.gb
*.nes
*.sfc
*.smc
*.fds
*.sav
*.state
rom/
build/
work/
**/tools/gbemu-cli/
**/tools/mesen/
**/tools/mesen-s/
__pycache__/
*.bps
*.ips
# Exception (owner's decision 2026-11-12): test saves made by a game's own tools, and (2026-11-15) saves the
# capture agents made while playing; both in games/<slug>/saves/, documented in its README.md. Downloaded saves
# stay in rom/saves/ (ignored).
!games/*/saves/*.sav
!games/*/saves/*.state
